        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2b2943fad1a640dabc6cdea36082a5d7",
      "statement": "The runtime is stdlib-first (http.server ThreadingHTTPServer plus sqlite3) with cryptography as the only hard runtime dependency; FastAPI, Pydantic, uvicorn and any other new runtime dependency are forbidden, so the validation those frameworks would provide is implemented explicitly in manifest.py and the HTTP layer.",
