    {
      "id": "claim_b01b7fcb59074cbfb80be8708b294757",
      "statement": "Legacy haap-client wire compatibility is a hard requirement: the unmodified haap registry_client (register, search, heartbeat against POST /register, POST /register/complete, POST /heartbeat, GET /search and GET /agents/{fp}) must keep working, with /v1/* canonical, and the compat test test_compat_client.py drives that unmodified client end-to-end but is skipped unless HAAP_REPO or a sibling ../haap checkout provides the companion package.",
