    {
      "id": "claim_0cb736d888ae4755b93d37ba5fe30175",
      "statement": "Configuration precedence is CLI flags above ~/.haap/dird.json above HAAP_DIRD_* environment variables above built-in defaults, applied in that order by DirectoryConfig.load with per-field type coercion; the config object holds only plain non-secret operational settings, while the directory Ed25519 signing key is handled separately by keystore.py (JSON file with 0600 permissions, default <db>.dirkey.json) and is never part of any config object.",
