    {
      "id": "claim_60104ff374b54d799a373f934aa6ebb6",
      "statement": "One process composes one Store, one DirectoryService and one HTTP server: DirectoryHTTPServer is the composition root whose build method constructs the Store and DirectoryService, each request runs on a ThreadingHTTPServer daemon thread, and DirectoryService attaches its L2–L5 sub-services (DomainService, VouchService, ReputationService, ModerationService, AuditService) in _attach_subservices, all sharing the same store and injected clock.",
