    {
      "id": "claim_d130554b48ed4eafb90af94a1303f254",
      "statement": "DirectoryService.build_trust_block assembles the §5.2 trust object from exactly the L1–L5 signals that exist for the row (L1 proof/freshness dates, L2 primary domain verification, L3 vouch edges and structural annotations, L4 report counters/status/block_recommendation, L5 audit_verifiable) with honest no-signal-yet defaults and no aggregate score or verdict field, and search applies only consumer-chosen trust filters (_passes_trust_filters) that gate inclusion — min_age_hours, domain_verified, not_suspended, min_vouches_in, recent_reports_max — never ranking by trust.",
